name: Result first value, explicit scope and folded command history
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/reader_first_value.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
expect: command folded
keys: Escape
live-snap: notice-dismissed
keys: Escape
live-snap: navigate-for-filter
keys: /
keys: owned_omitted_context Enter
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | folded-command
expect: command folded
expect: filter match
expect: c read commands
keys: c
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 owned_omitted_context | full-command
expect: c fold commands
keys: c
require-live-snap: 20 command folded | refolded-command
expect: c read commands
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/reader_first_value.py @TMP_TARGET @ART echo
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 z expand | logs-restored
keys: /
keys: Escape
keys: G
keys: Escape
keys: c
require-live-snap: 20 kz> c | composer-owns-c
keys: BSpace
ask: Does the folded echo keep the refusal visible, expose complete command text through z then c, and restore reading without stealing normal typing or starting work?
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/invalid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Invariant context draft failed | paid-failure
expect: command folded
expect: No repair request
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/reader_first_value.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
paste-file: @ART/generate-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Invariant context drafts: 1; partial | generated
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/reader_first_value.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | result-120x36
expect: Scope not recorded
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 owned-assumption | result-60x20
expect: Invariant context drafts: 1
expect: Outcome · partial
expect: cost unavailable
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 owned-assumption | result-40x12
expect: Invariant context drafts: 1
expect: Outcome · partial
expect: cost unavailable
expect: calls 2/3 at read
expect: Scope not recorded
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | result-tail-40x12
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Inputs | inputs-40x12
expect: Source: owned café.c
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Receipt | receipt-40x12
keys: Tab
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 owned-assumption | result-restored-40x12
expect: Invariant context drafts: 1
ask: Is the candidate visible immediately while partial status, uncertain cost and current call accounting remain clear at all six sizes, with the complete summary and original text still reachable?
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/exhausted-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted: 2 calls committed | exhausted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/reader_first_value.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | restarted-result
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | restarted-result-40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 owned-assumption | no-color-first-result
expect: Invariant context drafts: 1
expect: Outcome · partial
expect: cost unavailable
expect: calls 2/3 at read
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/reader_first_value.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart keep the first result readable, preserve accounting and protected Review, and leave further work unapproved?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
